  "body": "Fast. Play when a ⭐, \"+1,\" or \"0\" token is revealed during an investigation.\nChoose an asset you control with uses (supply, charge, or secret). Ready that asset if it is exhausted. Place either 1 supply, charge, or secret on that asset. You may take 1 additional action this turn, which can only be used on an ➡️ ability on the chosen asset.",
